   "data": {
    "text": "COMEDY FROM THE MIX\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 7, CC 1 to 14\n   1 How different the personalities are\n   2 Chaos in an orderly room\n   3 Gap in rank\n   4 What the mix does to the plot\n   5 What the mix does to the characters\n   6 Laughs from the mix\n   7 suite: Comedy from the mix lens\n   8 suite: Straight one and funny one\n   9 suite: Chaos agent\n  10 pair: When a chaos character enters an orderly room, the cringe rises\n  11 pair: When opposite personality types share the room, more of the laughs come from the mix\n  12 pair: When the gap in rank grows, the plot takes a turn\n  13 pair: Pride before a fall\n  14 pairs: The mix makes it funny"
   },
